  <h1 class="hero-title">The <em>Living Document</em><br>Specification</h1>
  <p class="hero-subtitle">A study on the open-source format for non-fiction engineered for dual-cognitive processing — written simultaneously for humans and AI agents.</p>
  <div class="hero-meta">
    <div class="hero-meta-item">
      <span class="hero-meta-label">Authored by</span>
      <span class="hero-meta-value">Mohammad EL-Dharrat</span>
